rsor: pointer; box-shadow: rgba(196, 168, 255, 0.2) 0px 0px 18px;\">IDLE</button><button class=\"mira-btn\" aria-pressed=\"false\" style=\"padding: 8px 13px; background: rgba(16, 6, 30, 0.72); color: rgb(196, 168, 255); border: 1px solid rgba(196, 168, 255, 0.333); border-radius: 9px; font: 12px &quot;Share Tech Mono&quot;, monospace; letter-spacing: 0.14em; cursor: pointer; box-shadow: rgba(196, 168, 255, 0.08) 0px 0px 18px;\">LISTENING</button><button class=\"mira-btn\" aria-pressed=\"false\" style=\"padding: 8px 13px; background: rgba(16, 6, 30, 0.72); color: rgb(196, 168, 255); border: 1px solid rgba(196, 168, 255, 0.333); border-radius: 9px; font: 12px &quot;Share Tech Mono&quot;, monospace; letter-spacing: 0.14em; cursor: pointer; box-shadow: rgba(196, 168, 255, 0.08) 0px 0px 18px;\">TALKING</button><button class=\"mira-btn\" aria-pressed=\"false\" title=\"While she talks, her voice follows your microphone's loudness\" style=\"padding: 8px 13px; background: rgba(16, 6, 30, 0.72); color: rgb(196, 168, 255); border: 1px solid rgba(196, 168, 255, 0.333); border-radius: 9px; font: 12px &quot;Share Tech Mono&quot;, monospace; letter-spacing: 0.14em; cursor: pointer; box-shadow: rgba(196, 168, 255, 0.08) 0px 0px 18px;\">MIC OFF</button></div></div></div>\n  \n\n</body></html>",
